# 后端测试**纳入仓库**（2026-08-27 改）。此前排除在外的理由是不纳入公开仓库，
# 代价是没有任何一条 CI 守得住回归——直到一次静默的生产数据丢失（closed_trades
# 重建清空数据、服务起不来，见 CURRENT_SCHEMA_REV 的 rev 8）逼出这个结论：
# 那类 bug 全程不报错，只有测试能拦住，而测试留在本地等于没有。
# 纳入前已把夹具里的真实 MT5 账号换成假号（公开仓库不该出现真实账号）。
# Backend tests are now tracked (2026-08-27). They were excluded to keep them out
# of a public repo, at the cost of no CI guarding any regression — until a silent
# production data loss (the closed_trades rebuild emptying the table while the
# service failed to start; see rev 8) settled the question: that class of bug
# raises nothing, only a test catches it, and a test that lives only on one
# machine catches nothing. Real MT5 logins in the fixtures were replaced with
# fake ones before tracking, since a public repo is no place for them.

