# 打包配置**要**入库（2026-09-20 改）。此前 `bridge/*.spec` 被一并忽略，理由大概是
# 「PyInstaller 会自己生成」——但这份 spec 早就不是生成物了：它手工维护着 hiddenimports
# （pystray/PIL 的运行时后端、cryptography 的 ed25519 与 Rust 扩展）、datas、以及
# upx=False / console=False 这些带解释的取舍。
#
# 不入库的代价是实打实的：**只有打过包的那台机器能复现构建**，换台机器重新生成一份
# 干净 spec，漏掉的依赖不会报错，只会让对应功能静默失效——cryptography 那条尤其阴，
# 漏了之后程序照常跑、照常交易，只有「一键更新」悄悄退回手动下载。
#
# The packaging spec is tracked as of 2026-09-20. It is hand-maintained (hiddenimports
# for runtime-only backends and the lazily imported cryptography/ed25519 Rust binding,
# plus explained upx/console choices), not a generated artifact. Leaving it untracked
# meant only one machine could reproduce a build, and a regenerated spec would drop
# those imports silently — the app still runs, only one-click update quietly dies.
!bridge/PRISMX-Bridge.spec

# ===== 文档 / Markdown（不纳入仓库；md 里常含密钥/内部信息）=====
# Docs / Markdown — never committed; may contain keys or internal info.
*.md
docs/
.trae/
# 例外：桥接的 README 入库（2026-09-21）。必须写在 *.md 之后——.gitignore 后面的规则
# 覆盖前面的，放在前面会被 *.md 重新盖掉。bridge_app.py 顶部的注释把「发版签名」流程指向
# 它，而这条链路做错一次（私钥换法不对、资产名改了）全部存量用户会退回手动下载。不含密钥。
# Exception: the bridge README is tracked (2026-09-21). It has to follow *.md — later
# rules win, so placed earlier it would be re-ignored. bridge_app.py points at its
# release-signing section, and one mistake there sends every installed user back to
# manual downloads. No secrets in it.
!bridge/README.md

