# /brag 生成的宣传视频与素材：几十 MB 的 mp4/jpg，本地产物，不入库。
# 加这条的理由与上面 MetaTrader5SDK 那段相同——一个 `git add .` 就会把它们提交进
# 历史，而 git 历史里的大文件事后删不干净。
# Output of /brag (promo video + stills): tens of MB of local artifacts. Same
# reason as the MetaTrader5SDK rule above — one `git add .` writes them into
# history permanently.
brag-output*/

# 安卓打包器 apppack 的源码与产物镜像（独立 git 仓库，无 remote，不进本仓库）。
# 此前只写在 .git/info/exclude 里——那是本机私有文件，不随仓库分发：换一台机器
# 克隆后这个目录就成了未跟踪目录，一个 `git add .` 会把 136 MB（含签名私钥路径与
# APK/AAB 产物）提交进历史。理由与上面 MetaTrader5SDK / brag-output 两条相同。
# The Android packager (its own git repo, no remote). Previously ignored only via
# .git/info/exclude, which is machine-local and does not travel with clones — on a
# fresh clone one `git add .` would commit 136 MB (signing-key paths, APK/AAB
# artifacts) into history. Same reasoning as MetaTrader5SDK / brag-output above.
APP Pack/

# ===== 本地密钥目录 / local signing keys =====
# 发版要用的私钥集中放在项目根的 keys/，绝不入库（仓库是公开的）。
# Release signing keys live in keys/ at the project root; never committed (public repo).
/keys/
